{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f WARNING: This is not a casual stroll through a fantasy world.</strong><br><i>Alaric's Quest</i> is a <strong>hardcore platformer</strong> in disguise. Don\u2019t be fooled by its cartoonish looks \u2014 this game pays tribute to classics like <i>Ghouls 'n Ghosts</i> and <i>Prehistorik 2</i>.<br>Expect to <strong>die a lot</strong>. But fear not! There's a <strong>God Mode</strong> for the less masochistic among you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alaric's Quest</i> is a love letter to a time when games didn\u2019t explain everything, and victory meant something.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alaric's Quest</i> is a challenging 2D platformer set in a vibrant hand-drawn medieval world. Take control of Alaric and embark on a deadly journey to recover your stolen book collection by surviving deadly traps, solving puzzles, and defeating ruthless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and yes \u2014 <strong>you\u2019ll have to explore even the controls</strong>. Even the tutorial won\u2019t hold your hand. Just like when you were a kid, with no internet, and your cousin handed you a random game with no manual \u2014 <strong>for the love of retro, go check the options menu!</strong> We won\u2019t spoon-feed you here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Windows, Linux, and Steam Deck. Play with keyboard, gamepad, or touchscreen.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/77fb486074e948c8064d0a606785b0d6.poster.avif?t=1751980408\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/77fb486074e948c8064d0a606785b0d6.webm?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/77fb486074e948c8064d0a606785b0d6.mp4?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/4cc7367c6d290829c49280f06704f0ab.avif?t=1751980408\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Exciting Platforming Experience</strong> \u2013 <i>Alaric's Quest</i> offers classic platforming gameplay with <strong>precise jumps, challenging obstacles, and clever traps</strong>. You'll need to master jumping mechanics and carefully explore each level to progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Variety of Levels and Challenges</strong> \u2013 The game features a <strong>wide range of levels</strong>, each with its own set of challenges and puzzles to solve. Face <strong>ferocious enemies, dodge deadly traps, and uncover hidden secrets</strong> as you explore the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Multi-Platform and Controller Support</strong> \u2013 <i>Alaric's Quest</i> is available for <strong>Linux, Windows, and SteamDeck</strong>, ensuring you can enjoy the adventure on your favorite devices. The game is also compatible with <strong>keyboard, gamepad, and touchscreen controls</strong>, offering flexibility in how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Accessible Yet Challenging Gameplay</strong> \u2013 The game features <strong>easy-to-learn controls</strong>, making it accessible to players of all ages and skill levels. However, as you progress, levels become <strong>increasingly difficult</strong>, testing even the most experienced players. Get ready to <strong>face clever traps and formidable enemies</strong> as you advance in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.poster.avif?t=1751980408\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.webm?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463480/extras/0cf60530dae47b6953cd2473d6e055fd.mp4?t=1751980408\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Afraid To Shoot Strangers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/2856b6ee0a13cff0b6d226ac552be8e80df0b11b.jpg"},{"name":"Like a rolling Stone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/2dd8ed682581aa508e8e3080d1f01a7657c225ad.jpg"},{"name":"Blowing in the wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/2987dd5a8f83436721df7631cc57e5c2332b27c1.jpg"},{"name":"Let There Be light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/c783c150290e20c0545db101bdf3465ecd67bb48.jpg"},{"name":"I am the sword","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/c2615f2ed608a79b90f23c95bc1b21f90054e00a.jpg"},{"name":"In the Arms of Sleep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/73fc9a45779b260f99b8d1ee5acf183a16b58797.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity killed the cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/dd6dd7b0a5f557513120006a21cc80cfc56398ac.jpg"},{"name":"Dust and Bones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2463480/acd9c476a7782df65b08772732f2e3e2